# The onap-ui-* libraries are developed in Gerrit (sdc/onap-ui-common, sdc/onap-ui-angular,
# sdc/onap-ui-react) and released only to ONAP Nexus. npmjs.org still serves the older GitHub-era
# builds and has not been published to since 2022, so the two registries disagree about which
# versions exist: a range like ^1.0.101 picks 1.1.0 here and 1.0.119 there. Jenkins defaulted to
# Nexus while developer machines and GitHub Actions defaulted to npmjs.org, which is how SDC-4904
# went red in CI while every local build stayed green. Pinning the group makes them agree; it
# proxies npmjs.org, so the rest of the dependency tree still resolves.
#
# For the same reason the onap-ui-* versions in package.json are exact rather than ranges: this
# module's yarn.lock is gitignored, so a range is re-resolved on every build and any new upstream
# release silently changes what ships. (Noted here rather than beside the dependency because
# package.json cannot carry comments.)
registry=https://nexus3.onap.org/repository/npm.public/
